<div class="events">
  <h2 class="eventstitle">EVENTS</h2>
  <div class="eventsbanner">
    <h2 class="bannerquote">
      “We don’t organize events. <br />We create memories.”
    </h2>
    <img class="bannerimg" src="../../public/images/woman.png" alt="memories" />
  </div>
  <p class="eventstext">
    Our events are private, curated and intentionally limited. Each experience
    is designed to operate beyond entertainment, creating environments of
    immersion, tension and desire. Access is not open. It is defined.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .events {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background-color: #0c0c09;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .eventstitle {
    padding: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: red;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .eventstitle::after {
    content: "";
    width: 4rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .eventsbanner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    width: 100%;
    height: 8rem;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
    background-image: url("../../public/images/humo.jpg");
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .bannerquote {
    padding: 2rem;
    font-size: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: 1vw;
    line-height: 2.5rem;
  }
  .bannerimg {
    height: 10rem;
  }
  .eventstext {
    margin: 4rem 0;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    text-align: justify;
    width: 70vw;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }
</style>
